## 🧪 Part 3: Testing

### Test MQTT Connection

On your Raspberry Pi:
```bash
# Subscribe to all topics
mosquitto_sub -h localhost -t "hospital/#" -v

# In another terminal, publish a test message
mosquitto_pub -h localhost -t "hospital/test" -m "Hello from Pi"
```

### Test from Dashboard

1. Open browser console (F12)
2. Look for: `✅ Connected to MQTT broker over WebSocket`
3. Check for: `📋 Subscribed to patient data`

