## 📊 MQTT Topic Structure

| Topic | Purpose | Data Format |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| `hospital/patient` | Patient vitals & info | JSON with health data |
| `hospital/gps` | Ambulance location | JSON with lat, lng, ETA |
| `hospital/chat/doctor` | Doctor → Ambulance | JSON with message, timestamp |
| `hospital/chat/ambulance` | Ambulance → Doctor | JSON with message, timestamp |

